│ RaktSetu - Development Plan                                                                                                                                                                │
│                                                                                                                                                                                            │
│ Context                                                                                                                                                                                    │
│                                                                                                                                                                                            │
│ RaktSetu is a cloud-based, real-time blood donor finder platform being built from scratch as a Major Project (academic). It connects patients/hospitals with nearby eligible blood donors  │
│ using geo-spatial matching and ML-based donor availability prediction. The goal is a fully functional full-stack application with 3 user roles, real-time notifications, map-based donor   │
│ discovery, and a trained ML model on synthetic data.                                                                                                                                       │
│                                                                                                                                                                                            │
│ Decisions                                                                                                                                                                                  │
│                                                                                                                                                                                            │
│ - ML: Simulated data + real scikit-learn model (Random Forest/XGBoost) exposed via Flask API                                                                                               │
│ - User Roles: 3 roles — Donor, Patient, Hospital (separate dashboards)                                                                                                                     │
│ - Maps: Mapbox (requires API key)                                                                                                                                                          │
│ - Deployment: Local Docker Compose first, AWS later                                                                                                                                        │
│                                                                                                                                                                                            │
