│ MODULE 1: Project Scaffolding & Database Setup                                                                                                                                             │
│                                                                                                                                                                                            │
│ Duration: First                                                                                                                                                                            │
│                                                                                                                                                                                            │
│ 1. Initialize project structure (folders, package.json, etc.)                                                                                                                              │
│ 2. Set up MongoDB schemas:                                                                                                                                                                 │
│   - User — name, email, password (hashed), role (donor/patient/hospital), phone, bloodGroup, location (GeoJSON Point), lastDonationDate, isAvailable, createdAt                            │
│   - BloodRequest — requesterId, bloodGroup, urgency (normal/urgent/critical), location (GeoJSON Point), status (open/matched/fulfilled/expired), matchedDonors[], fulfilledBy,             │
│ hospitalName, createdAt                                                                                                                                                                    │
│   - DonationHistory — donorId, requestId, respondedAt, accepted (bool), donatedAt                                                                                                          │
│   - Notification — userId, type, message, read, requestId, createdAt                                                                                                                       │
│ 3. Set up geo-spatial indexes (2dsphere) on User.location and BloodRequest.location                                                                                                        │
│ 4. Environment config (.env) for MongoDB URI, JWT secret, Mapbox token, ML service URL                                                                                                     │
│                                                                                                                                                                                            │
│ MODULE 2: Backend API — Authentication & User Management                                                                                                                                   │
│                                                                                                                                                                                            │
│ Duration: Second                                                                                                                                                                           │
│                                                                                                                                                                                            │
│ 1. JWT-based authentication (register, login, logout)                                                                                                                                      │
│ 2. Role-based middleware (donor, patient, hospital)                                                                                                                                        │
│ 3. API endpoints:                                                                                                                                                                          │
│   - POST /api/auth/register — register with role selection                                                                                                                                 │
│   - POST /api/auth/login — returns JWT + user data                                                                                                                                         │
│   - GET /api/auth/me — get current user profile                                                                                                                                            │
│   - PUT /api/users/profile — update profile, location, availability                                                                                                                        │
│   - GET /api/users/donors — list donors (hospital role, with filters)                                                                                                                      │
│ 4. Password hashing with bcrypt                                                                                                                                                            │
│ 5. Input validation with express-validator or Joi                                                                                                                                          │
│                                                                                                                                                                                            │
│ MODULE 3: Backend API — Blood Request & Donor Matching                                                                                                                                     │
│                                                                                                                                                                                            │
│ Duration: Third                                                                                                                                                                            │
│                                                                                                                                                                                            │
│ 1. Blood request CRUD:                                                                                                                                                                     │
│   - POST /api/requests — create blood request (patient/hospital)                                                                                                                           │
│   - GET /api/requests — list requests (filtered by role)                                                                                                                                   │
│   - GET /api/requests/:id — request details with matched donors                                                                                                                            │
│   - PUT /api/requests/:id — update status                                                                                                                                                  │
│ 2. Geo-spatial donor matching engine:                                                                                                                                                      │
│   - Find donors within configurable radius (default 10km, max 50km)                                                                                                                        │
│   - Filter by blood group compatibility                                                                                                                                                    │
│   - Filter by eligibility (lastDonationDate > 90 days ago, isAvailable: true)                                                                                                              │
│   - Call ML service to get availability scores                                                                                                                                             │
│   - Rank donors by: ML score + proximity + eligibility                                                                                                                                     │
│   - Return top N donors                                                                                                                                                                    │
│ 3. Donor response endpoints:                                                                                                                                                               │
│   - POST /api/requests/:id/respond — donor accepts/declines                                                                                                                                │
│   - PUT /api/requests/:id/fulfill — mark as fulfilled                                                                                                                                      │
│                                                                                                                                                                                            │
│ MODULE 4: Real-time Notifications (Socket.io)                                                                                                                                              │
│                                                                                                                                                                                            │
│ Duration: Fourth                                                                                                                                                                           │
│                                                                                                                                                                                            │
│ 1. Socket.io server setup integrated with Express                                                                                                                                          │
│ 2. JWT-based socket authentication                                                                                                                                                         │
│ 3. Events:                                                                                                                                                                                 │
│   - new-request — notify matched donors when a blood request is created                                                                                                                    │
│   - donor-response — notify requester when a donor accepts/declines                                                                                                                        │
│   - request-fulfilled — notify all parties when donation completes                                                                                                                         │
│ 4. Notification persistence in MongoDB (for offline users)                                                                                                                                 │
│ 5. REST endpoint: GET /api/notifications — fetch unread notifications                                                                                                                      │
│                                                                                                                                                                                            │
│ MODULE 5: ML Microservice — Donor Availability Prediction                                                                                                                                  │
│                                                                                                                                                                                            │
│ Duration: Fifth                                                                                                                                                                            │
│                                                                                                                                                                                            │
│ 1. Synthetic data generation script:                                                                                                                                                       │
│   - Generate 5000+ donor interaction records                                                                                                                                               │
